message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "@three-ws/assistant"
abstract: "A 3D avatar assistant for any website in one script tag. A floating launcher opens a real animated avatar with a chatbot mode (free models or the visitor's own Groq/OpenRouter key) and a speak mode that says whatever you type, out loud, in a speech bubble."
